			<h1 ><span class="big-bold" data-aos-easing="ease" data-aos-delay="300" data-aos="fade-up">Automate Processes. </span><br/><span data-aos-easing="ease" data-aos-delay="600" data-aos="fade-up">Visualise Data.</span><br/><span class="waste" data-aos-easing="ease" data-aos-delay="900" data-aos="fade-up">Measure Performance</span> <br/></h1>
