<section class="home-sections about-opiam">
<div class="container ">
	<div class="row">
		
		<div class="col-md-6 text-center">
			<img data-aos-easing="ease" data-aos-delay="300" data-aos="fade-up" src="images/about-opiam-pic2.png" width="" height="" alt="" />
		</div>
		<div class="col-md-6 ">
			<h2 data-aos-easing="ease" data-aos-delay="600" data-aos="fade-up" class="text-upppercase">About Opiam</h2>
			<p data-aos-easing="ease" data-aos-delay="900" data-aos="fade-up">Opiam is an integrated cost and performance management tool that works as part of the automated processes, measuring quality, cost and time. Our vision is to see that organisations work by itself, freeing up human resource’s for creative works such as innovation.</p>
			<p data-aos-easing="ease" data-aos-delay="1200" data-aos="fade-up">Opiam is designed and delivered to you by a group of specialists, who has  in-depth understanding of how technologies work, and how performance improvement frameworks such as balanced scorecard and activity based costing can be deployed in organisations to create breakthrough improvements in operations and strategy.</p>
			<a  href="#" class="btn btn-light btn-opiam btn-learnmore">Learn More <span class="icon-keyboard_arrow_right"></span></a>
		</div>		
	</div>
</div>
</section>


	
	










